<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Set Up Direct Debit - {{clubName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #7C3AED 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #F5F3FF;
      border-left: 4px solid #8B5CF6;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .info-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      color: #6D28D9;
    }
    .benefits {
      background: #F0FDF4;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .benefits h3 {
      margin: 0 0 15px 0;
      color: #059669;
    }
    .benefits ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .benefits li {
      padding: 5px 0;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #8B5CF6;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: #7C3AED;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    .guarantee-badge {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 15px;
      background: #FEF3C7;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .guarantee-badge img {
      max-width: 150px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Set Up Your Direct Debit</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{familyName}},</p>

      <p>To make paying for swimming club fees easier and more convenient, we use <strong>GoCardless</strong> to collect payments via Direct Debit.</p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <h3>Action Required</h3>
        <p>Please set up your Direct Debit mandate to ensure uninterrupted access to club services and activities.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefits">
        <h3>Benefits of Direct Debit</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Automatic payment collection - no need to remember due dates</li>
          <li>{{#if isBecs}}Protected under the Direct Debit Request Service Agreement{{else}}Protected by the Direct Debit Guarantee{{/if}}</li>
          <li>Easy to manage and cancel at any time</li>
          <li>Secure and reliable payment method</li>
          <li>Reduces administrative burden for the club</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{setupUrl}}" class="button">Set Up Direct Debit Now</a>
      </div>

{{#if isBecs}}
      <div class="guarantee-badge">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #92400E;">Protected under the BECS Direct Debit rules</p>
        <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #78350F;">Your Direct Debit Request is governed by the Bulk Electronic Clearing System (BECS) rules and the Direct Debit Request Service Agreement.</p>
      </div>

      <p><strong>What is the Direct Debit Request Service Agreement?</strong></p>
      <ul style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;">
        <li>If there are any changes to the amount, date or frequency of your Direct Debit, {{clubName}} will notify you at least 14 days in advance</li>
        <li>If a payment is taken in error, you are entitled to a refund from your bank</li>
        <li>You can cancel a Direct Debit Request at any time by contacting your bank</li>
      </ul>
{{else}}
      <div class="guarantee-badge">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #92400E;">Protected by the Direct Debit Guarantee</p>
        <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #78350F;">This Guarantee is offered by all banks and building societies that accept instructions to pay Direct Debits.</p>
      </div>

      <p><strong>What is the Direct Debit Guarantee?</strong></p>
      <ul style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748B;">
        <li>If there are any changes to the amount, date or frequency of your Direct Debit, {{clubName}} will notify you at least 3 working days in advance</li>
        <li>If an error is made in the payment of your Direct Debit, you are entitled to a full and immediate refund from your bank</li>
        <li>You can cancel a Direct Debit at any time by contacting your bank</li>
      </ul>
{{/if}}

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">The setup process is quick and secure, taking just a few minutes to complete.</p>

      <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Best regards,<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Payments are processed securely by GoCardless</p>
      <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
